<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cullinan advises caution on unit disposal.</title>
<headline>Cullinan advises caution on unit disposal.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Holding firm Cullinan Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday its disposal of the Midrand brick plant to Tongaat Hullet Group Ltd was still subject to certain conditions precedent.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
<p>E-mail: johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
